            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "López, R. and Heifets, B. (2023). TRAPing Context- and Region-Specific Ensemble Activity Induced by (±) 3,4- Methylenedioxymethamphetamine. Stanford Digital Repository. Available at https://purl.stanford.edu/fk541qf4793",
